000010 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000020 PROGRAM-ID. CONT1.
000030 DATA DIVISION.
000040 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
000050 01  BALANCE         PIC S9(4) VALUE -25.
000060 01  CODE-IN         PIC X     VALUE "B".
000070 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
000080     IF BALANCE >= 0
000090         CONTINUE
000100     ELSE
000110         DISPLAY "OVERDRAWN BY " BALANCE
000120     END-IF
000130     EVALUATE CODE-IN
000140         WHEN "A"
000150             DISPLAY "CODE A"
000160         WHEN "B"
000170             CONTINUE
000180         WHEN OTHER
000190             DISPLAY "UNKNOWN CODE"
000200     END-EVALUATE
000210     DISPLAY "DONE"
000220     STOP RUN.
